  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="feed-reshare-content__commentary">The Antigravity CLI is just a few days old (in the public) but a few GDEs have taken off the blocks immediately.

First up, check out <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/xbill?trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>William McLean</a>'s series on Antigravity CLI, that demonstrates how to get started with Antigravity CLI on a stock Linux environment and a follow up to code and integrate a local MCP Servers into Antigravity CLI:
➡️ Getting Started with Antigravity CLI : <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F4uudpTb&amp;urlhash=jAP0&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4uudpTb</a>
➡️ Local MCP Development with Python and Antigravity CLI : <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F4wNvaye&amp;urlhash=0IlV&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4wNvaye</a>

Next up, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/darren-lester-architect?trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Darren Lester</a> has started to explore too and has dived straight in to help you migrate your key stuff (MCP Servers, Skills, etc) from Gemini CLI to Antigravity CLI. Keep a lookout for his medium blog.
➡️ Configuring MCP Servers and Skills for Antigravity CLI and IDE:  <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F4f0l6LV&amp;urlhash=CNxh&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4f0l6LV</a>

Finally, check out <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/aashi-dutt?trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aashi D.</a>'s deep dive covers a key strength of Antigravity CLI i.e. subagents. The article dives creation of dynamic subagents that work with a real world dataset and demonstrates how a natural language query results in the generation of multiple subagents that clean, analyze, and visualize the data, producing a complete interactive HTML dashboard with no code.
➡️  Orchestrating Parallel AI Agents: <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F4tSGbeY&amp;urlhash=aaV2&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4tSGbeY</a>

And if you still want more, check out a tutorial series that I have started to document my learnings/experiments as I discover more about Antigravity CLI:
➡️ Antigravity CLI Tutorial Series : Part 1 : Getting Started : <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F3PGkznV&amp;urlhash=Iovd&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/3PGkznV</a>
➡️ Antigravity CLI Tutorial Series: Part 2 : Conversations, Conversations and Conversations : <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F4nNOyXU&amp;urlhash=T9Uj&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4nNOyXU</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fantigravitycli&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AntigravityCLI</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fterminal&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Terminal</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fagents&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Agents</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fantigravity&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Antigravity</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgoogle&amp;trk=public_post_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Google</a>

