  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Nothing like a new Sprint to take a deeper dive into a specific tech.

The latest one is a Data Sprint around Apache Iceberg- which holds the promise of consistent cross vendor data management.

Does it meet this in reality?   Somewhat.

But the gap between marketing copy and actual deployments is real.  

So what did I do?

Seven Iceberg REST Catalogs: What They Declare, and What They Serve

One request suite against seven Apache Iceberg REST catalog implementations — Polaris, BigLake, Glue, S3 Tables, Unity, Horizon and OneLake — comparing what each catalog declares it supports against what it actually serves.

What is in it:

- Eleven overclaims across four vendors. Endpoints a catalog names in its own /v1/config and then does not serve. Only the open-source control, Apache Polaris, declares honestly.
- Two of seven publish no declaration at all. Glue and S3 Tables leave a client no way to discover their surface short of probing it.
- Views are effectively a Polaris-only feature. Six operations, six managed catalogs, zero implementations.
- "Supports the REST catalog" is true and not very informative. All seven served the core read path. The divergence is in the write surface, in the update actions inside one endpoint, and in operational semantics.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdev%2Eto&amp;urlhash=zTdX&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>dev.to</a> (Google Developer Experts): <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgrMHsg8M&amp;urlhash=nPeQ&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/grMHsg8M</a>
AWS Builder Center: <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2Fgxh2APv2&amp;urlhash=kzM3&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gxh2APv2</a>
Medium: <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgFkdxDZD&amp;urlhash=hbI_&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gFkdxDZD</a>
Source: <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgtEZwuSK&amp;urlhash=dGgq&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gtEZwuSK</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgde&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GDE</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fawscommunitybuilder&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AWSCommunityBuilder</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ficeberg&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#iceberg</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdatasprint&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#datasprint</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Faisprint&amp;trk=public_post-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="public_post-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AISprint</a>
